{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Walking along a solitary path, you come across a lonely cave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But this cave holds mysteries and a darkness inside of it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you want to or not, you must traverse it to retrieve your core.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gone Down, traverse a deep cave with many mysteries as a little slime, that must go down to retrieve their core. Travel the many layers of the cave exploring its secrets as you dash and platform your way to the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise and unforgiving platforming\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Layers with varying designs and obstacles</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Solitary Entrance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927070/6869797aa990891c0e509fd4d702a71883c85c5f.jpg"},{"name":"A Metallic Factory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927070/a45ddfe9e485f992b6aa2bc37b26debd72403777.jpg"},{"name":"A Mystical Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927070/9ee7c9209391f75e680bc2c2728a2d93f5298cc4.jpg"},{"name":"A Dark Cavern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927070/3cf4f186c59b10d6b93e020d636484374a64df3f.jpg"},{"name":"A Crystalline Cavern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927070/33fddb5a59b0ba89abbb23e78c572d678f7e0679.jpg"},{"name":"An Ancient Temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927070/bca2d8ae32b198451b77bba3922918790330b1fd.jpg"},{"name":"A Fiery Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927070/018f8ec1f1e2a07b1086ae283a6f3e590ec105f1.jpg"},{"name":